Electromagnetics Volume 2 — Steven W. Ellingson (@em-ellingson2: 0, is #reference, #part-of @em-sources) { r_5P52CZD00XV6MMPFY9RHADT5KJ
Steven W. Ellingson. Electromagnetics, Volume 2, Virginia Tech Publishing, 2020. DOI 10.21061/electromagnetics-vol-2. [Institutional record](https://vtechworks.lib.vt.edu/handle/10919/93253) · [Institutional accessible PDF](https://vtechworks.lib.vt.edu/bitstream/handle/10919/93253/Electromagnetics_Vol2_screen-reader-friendly.pdf).

Read the whole volume after the first: practical field laws and forces, propagation in lossy media, skin effects, reflection/transmission, waveguides and related transmission systems, optical fibres, radiation and antennas. Use its examples alongside the more general physical accounts.

The institutional/publisher identification states 216 printed pages and CC BY-SA 4.0, subject to component notices. Metadata and indexed front matter were checked on 29 October 2026; direct institutional retrieval timed out and the publisher file returned 403. Full-page inspection of this volume is not claimed. Confirm the actual version and errata when reading it. Nothing is bundled.

